    <node id="Vision">
      <data key="d0">Vision</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The ability to see, including visual acuity and visual fields, which is essential for operating a motor vehicle.&lt;SEP&gt;The ability to see, which declines with normal ageing and is a key factor in assessing fitness to drive.&lt;SEP&gt;The visual capability of an individual, measured by acuity ratios such as 6/18 or 6/9.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-EXP-d9bb83d3b77476a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-db731186cdb786e3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-e2669d1b502303f5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-003-chunk-000</data>
