      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An individual operating a motor vehicle, whose ability to drive safely depends on their vision.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual assessed for eligibility to hold an unconditional licence based on visual acuity standards.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who is assessed for fitness to hold a specific type of license.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who is assessed for fitness to hold a driving licence based on visual conditions.</data>
      <data key="d3">AFTD2022-EXP-d9bb83d3b77476a5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-004-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-007-chunk-000</data>
