    <edge source="Unconditional Licence" target="Person">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">A person is deemed unfit to hold an unconditional licence if their visual acuity fails to meet specific standards.&lt;SEP&gt;A person is not eligible to hold an unconditional licence if they have a visual field defect.&lt;SEP&gt;A person is not eligible to hold an unconditional licence if they experience diplopia within a specific visual field range.</data>
      <data key="d9">criteria,disqualification,eligibility,fitness,qualification,restriction,visual health</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-VIS-COM-002-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-004-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-007-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-VIS-COM-002&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-004&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-007</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761774</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Unconditional Licence" target="Six over Nine">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Holding an unconditional licence requires that the person's uncorrected visual acuity in the better eye not be worse than 6/9.</data>
      <data key="d9">restriction,standard,threshold</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-VIS-COM-002-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-VIS-COM-002</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761702</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Unconditional Licence" target="Six over Eighteen">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Holding an unconditional licence requires that the person's uncorrected visual acuity in either eye not be worse than 6/18.</data>
      <data key="d9">restriction,standard,threshold</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-VIS-COM-002-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-VIS-COM-002</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761702</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Unconditional Licence" target="Monocular Person">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">A person who is monocular is not fit to hold an unconditional licence.</data>
      <data key="d9">driving licence,eligibility,fitness</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-VIS-COM-006-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-VIS-COM-006</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761759</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Conditional Licence" target="Driver Licensing Authority">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The authority may consider a conditional licence subject to annual review based on information from treating optometrists or ophthalmologists.&lt;SEP&gt;For a conditional licence based on monocular vision, the authority reviews the case subject to a 2-yearly review.&lt;SEP&gt;The driver licensing authority grants conditional licences while taking into account the nature of the driving task and the medical condition.&lt;SEP&gt;The authority considers granting a conditional license subject to periodic review if the driver meets vision standards with corrective lenses.&lt;SEP&gt;The authority considers issuing the licence based on specific criteria and reviews it annually.&lt;SEP&gt;The driver licensing authority considers a conditional licence subject to 2-yearly review.</data>
      <data key="d9">assessment,consideration,criteria,granting,issuance,licensing,medical condition,period,regulation,review</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-117af1818c65d4ad-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-b9f8c41dbdf5f5ac-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-003-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-005-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-006-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-117af1818c65d4ad&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-b9f8c41dbdf5f5ac&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-003&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-005&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-006</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761759</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Conditional Licence" target="Treating Optometrist">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The optometrist provides information regarding the nature of the driving task and visual criteria to the licensing authority.&lt;SEP&gt;The optometrist provides data regarding the driver's visual field to inform the licensing decision.&lt;SEP&gt;A treating optometrist provides information regarding visual acuity and field to support the consideration of a conditional licence.</data>
      <data key="d9">assessment,criteria,information,medical input,visual field</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-117af1818c65d4ad-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-005-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-006-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-117af1818c65d4ad&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-005&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-006</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761759</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Conditional Licence" target="Treating Ophthalmologist">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The ophthalmologist provides information regarding the nature of the driving task and visual criteria to the licensing authority.</data>
      <data key="d9">assessment,information,visual field</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-117af1818c65d4ad-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-117af1818c65d4ad</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761494</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Conditional Licence" target="Binocular Visual Field">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">For a binocular visual field to meet conditional licence criteria, it must have an extent of at least 140 degrees within 10 degrees above and below the horizontal midline.&lt;SEP&gt;A minimum extent of at least 140 degrees within 10 degrees above and below the horizontal midline is a required criterion for the licence.</data>
      <data key="d9">criteria,extent,measurement,midline,requirement</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-117af1818c65d4ad-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-005-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-117af1818c65d4ad&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-005</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761737</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Conditional Licence" target="Significant Visual Field Loss">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">A person is not fit for a conditional licence if they have significant visual field loss (such as scotoma, hemianopia, or quadrantanopia) likely to impede driving performance.&lt;SEP&gt;For a conditional licence based on monocular vision, there must be no other significant visual field loss likely to impede driving performance.</data>
      <data key="d9">criteria,hemianopia,performance,quadrantanopia,remaining eye,scotoma</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-117af1818c65d4ad-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-117af1818c65d4ad</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761494</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Conditional Licence" target="Visual Field Loss">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">For a conditional licence based on binocular vision, the visual field loss must be static and unlikely to progress rapidly.&lt;SEP&gt;The visual field loss must be static and unlikely to progress rapidly to qualify for the licence.</data>
      <data key="d9">criteria,progression,stability,static</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-117af1818c65d4ad-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-005-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-117af1818c65d4ad&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-005</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761737</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Conditional Licence" target="Visual Acuity">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">For a conditional licence based on monocular vision, the visual acuity in the remaining eye must be 6/9 or better with or without correction.&lt;SEP&gt;A conditional licence requires visual acuity in the remaining eye to be 6/9 or better with or without correction.</data>
      <data key="d9">correction,criteria,remaining eye,requirement,vision</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-117af1818c65d4ad-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-006-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-117af1818c65d4ad&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-006</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761759</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Conditional Licence" target="Visual Field">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">For a conditional licence based on monocular vision, the visual field in the remaining eye must have a horizontal extent of at least 140 degrees within 10 degrees above and below the horizontal midline.&lt;SEP&gt;A conditional licence requires visual field in the remaining eye to have a horizontal extent of at least 140 degrees within 10 degrees above and below the horizontal midline.</data>
      <data key="d9">criteria,horizontal extent,midline,remaining eye,requirement,vision</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-117af1818c65d4ad-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-006-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-117af1818c65d4ad&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-VIS-COM-006</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761759</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
