      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-a5934e81e0aee450-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-a5934e81e0aee450</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761590</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Quadrantanopia" target="Visual fields">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">A specific type of visual field loss resulting from neurological conditions or injuries.</data>
      <data key="d9">injury,reduction type</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-adb72bb1f206f023-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-adb72bb1f206f023</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761608</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Visual Acuity" target="Motor Vehicle Crash Risk">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Reduced visual acuity is associated with an increased risk of motor vehicle crashes, although identifying the exact degree of this increase is challenging.</data>
      <data key="d9">correlation,driving safety,impairment</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-942a0e45a2a1e73d-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-942a0e45a2a1e73d</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761558</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Visual Acuity" target="Licensing Standards">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Evidence regarding visual acuity impairment is generally limited to drivers who already meet licensing standards, restricting the ability to determine if alternative cut-points are more appropriate.</data>
      <data key="d9">criteria,drivers,measurement</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-942a0e45a2a1e73d-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-942a0e45a2a1e73d</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761558</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Visual Acuity" target="Visual Fields">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Both visual acuity and visual fields are identified as the two main aspects of vision addressed in the chapter.</data>
      <data key="d9">assessment focus,vision aspects</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-e2669d1b502303f5-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-e2669d1b502303f5</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761677</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Visual Acuity" target="Person">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The fitness of a person to hold the licence is determined by measuring their uncorrected visual acuity.</data>
      <data key="d9">assessment,condition,measurement</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-VIS-COM-002-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-VIS-COM-002</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761702</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Monocular Vision" target="Commercial Vehicle Drivers">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">There is no flexibility for commercial vehicle drivers regarding monocular vision and its associated visual field reductions.</data>
      <data key="d9">assessment,restriction</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-a5934e81e0aee450-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-a5934e81e0aee450</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761590</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Significant Visual Field Loss" target="Driving Performance">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Significant visual field loss that is likely to impede driving performance disqualifies a person from holding a conditional licence.</data>
      <data key="d9">impediment,risk,safety</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-VIS-COM-006-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-VIS-COM-006</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761759</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Commercial standards" target="Unconditional licence">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">A person is not fit to hold an unconditional licence if they experience diplopia within 20 degrees from central fixation.&lt;SEP&gt;A person is not fit to hold an unconditional licence if their uncorrected visual acuity exceeds specific thresholds in either eye.</data>
      <data key="d9">driving,eligibility,fitness,limits,visual acuity</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-15bc1b265985cecd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-a09b64ac70a92828-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-15bc1b265985cecd&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-a09b64ac70a92828</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761570</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Commercial standards" target="Conditional licence">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">A person is not fit to hold a conditional licence if they experience diplopia within 20 degrees from central fixation.&lt;SEP&gt;A conditional licence may be considered by the driver licensing authority if the visual standard is met with corrective lenses or under specific vision conditions.</data>
      <data key="d9">corrective lenses,driving,eligibility,fitness,review</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-15bc1b265985cecd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-a09b64ac70a92828-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-15bc1b265985cecd&lt;SEP&gt;AFTD2022-EXP-a09b64ac70a92828</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761570</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Conditional licence" target="Driver licensing authority">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The driver licensing authority evaluates and considers a conditional licence subject to periodic review based on visual standards.</data>
      <data key="d9">assessment,granting,review</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-a09b64ac70a92828-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-a09b64ac70a92828</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761570</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Conditional licence" target="Visual fields">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Requires assessment of visual field defects and evidence of visual adaptation for management as an exceptional case.</data>
      <data key="d9">adaptation,management</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-adb72bb1f206f023-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-adb72bb1f206f023</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761608</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Orthokeratology" target="Rigid Gas-Permeable Contact Lenses">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Orthokeratology involves the therapeutic use of rigid gas-permeable contact lenses worn overnight.</data>
      <data key="d9">equipment,therapy,usage</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-1fc74bd52e776429-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-1fc74bd52e776429</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761515</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Orthokeratology" target="Cornea">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Orthokeratology is used to reshape the cornea of the eye through the application of contact lenses.</data>
      <data key="d9">effect,procedure,target</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-1fc74bd52e776429-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-1fc74bd52e776429</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761515</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Orthokeratology" target="Visual Refractive Error">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Orthokeratology provides effective correction of visual refractive error that can last at least a full day once the lenses are removed.</data>
      <data key="d9">correction,outcome,treatment</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-1fc74bd52e776429-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-1fc74bd52e776429</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761515</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Visual Acuity Standard" target="Orthokeratology Therapy">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The therapy provides the necessary support to maintain the established visual acuity standard.</data>
      <data key="d9">maintenance,support</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-2be0d66af7c59510-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-2be0d66af7c59510</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761524</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Visual Acuity Standard" target="Correcting Lenses">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">These lenses enable individuals to meet the visual acuity standard when other methods are not sufficient.</data>
      <data key="d9">correction,enable</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-2be0d66af7c59510-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-2be0d66af7c59510</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761524</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Visual Acuity Standard" target="Nystagmus">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Drivers with nystagmus must meet the visual acuity standard to ensure safety on the road.</data>
      <data key="d9">fitness to drive,regulation,safety</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-EXP-849e8ea0a6b9fb07-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-EXP-849e8ea0a6b9fb07</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761548</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Orthokeratology Therapy" target="Vision">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">This therapy is referenced as a method to meet the visual standard using corrective lenses for a conditional license.</data>
      <data key="d9">correction,improvement,standard</data>
      <data key="d10">AFTD2022-VIS-COM-003-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">AFTD2022-VIS-COM-003</data>
      <data key="d12">1792761717</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="Hearing Impairment" target="Fitness to Drive">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Hearing impairment may combine with other medical conditions to affect fitness to drive.</data>
      <data key="d9">concurrent conditions,impact</data>
